### Final Thought

Building a frontend for an e‑commerce site is a marathon, not a sprint. Start small, iterate fast, and keep the user experience at the heart of every decision. Once you have a solid foundation, you can layer in personalization, advanced analytics, and even AI‑driven features like chatbots or dynamic pricing.

Happy coding! 🚀
